This applet embeds a fenced Vim-derived terminal editor inside bx.

Import layout:
- vim/src/: copied Vim source snapshot used for the embedded core
- runtime/: curated Vim runtime subset shipped for syntax/filetype support

Local policy:
- bx exposes only the `vim` applet entrypoint
- startup is forced through bx_vim_startup.c
- user vimrc, modelines, plugins, package loading, and startup command injection are rejected
- runtimepath is reduced to the curated bx runtime tree
